1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,000
Security is an ever-growing concern for development teams.

2
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:08,000
Many organizations are beginning to shift left,

3
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:11,000
catching vulnerabilities before they reach production.

4
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:15,000
But security shouldn't make life difficult for developers.

5
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:17,000
That's why we built Dastidly,

6
00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:20,000
a free containerized DAST web application scanner

7
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:23,000
for your CI CD pipeline from Burp Suite.

8
00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:25,000
You may not have heard of Burp Suite,

9
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:27,000
