10
00:00:27,000 --> 00:00:30,000
It's the world's leading toolkit for web security testing,

11
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:33,000
used by over 16,000 organizations worldwide.

12
00:00:33,000 --> 00:00:37,000
And Dastidly is based on the exact same groundbreaking Burp Scanner.

13
00:00:37,000 --> 00:00:40,000
It looks at your application from the outside in,

14
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:41,000
